ollowing the Nameless Hero\u2019s steps, there is a mysterious voice \u2013 the Artist, the person who drew the world where the adventure takes place. Your story and his are connected in many ways \u2013 and your journey will touch your hearts and change you forever. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690120/extras/aacab9fbca33b414a67b7d173a97df23.poster.avif?t=1710145258\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690120/extras/aacab9fbca33b414a67b7d173a97df23.webm?t=1710145258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690120/extras/aacab9fbca33b414a67b7d173a97df23.mp4?t=1710145258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A heart-warming story to comfort your soul</strong><br>Inked is a wholesome narrative-driven puzzle game, a heart-warming story about loss and hope in a time where we all need some comfort.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690120/extras/12065d3b7872e0f0a709492f054465d5.poster.avif?t=1710145258\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690120/extras/12065d3b7872e0f0a709492f054465d5.webm?t=1710145258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690120/extras/12065d3b7872e0f0a709492f054465d5.mp4?t=1710145258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
